{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>וְנֶאֶחֲזוּ בְּתֹכְכֶם.</b> He accords them honor, for the meaning is: if they do not cross over armed, you shall lead them with them against their will, וְנֶאֶחֲזוּ. Or if they relent, וְנֶאֶחֲזוּ בְּתֹכְכֶם. This word comes in accordance with the rule of words with yod, for the letters alef, he, vav, yod interchange."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:09.648208884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}